This 180cm artificial Christmas tree features a snow-sprayed design that brings a realistic wintery feel to your home or office. The frosted green branches create an authentic festive atmosphere regardless of the weather outside, allowing you to enjoy a traditional white Christmas look indoors.

The tree includes an auto-open hinge mechanism that simplifies assembly by dropping the branches into place for quick setup. You only need to bend the tips into shape to achieve a full, natural appearance without complex tools or lengthy preparation times.

Being undressed and unlit, this pine-style tree offers complete freedom for personalisation with your choice of tinsel, lights and ornaments. You can dress it exactly how you want to match your specific interior decor theme or colour scheme for a unique customised look. This flexibility allows you to update the style annually without needing to purchase new decorative elements each year.

Constructed from tough flame retardant PVC plastic, this safe artificial tree provides peace of mind during the holiday season. The material is durable enough for long-term storage and reuse, ensuring it remains in good condition for years to come.

Each unit measures 105cm in diameter at the base and weighs approximately 6.8kg for stable placement on flat surfaces. The assembled dimensions provide a substantial presence in any room while remaining manageable for indoor display purposes.
